[l_english.MODULE_SPECIAL_DJ]
DJ Deck

[l_english.MODULE_SPECIAL_DJ_desc]
War is a tiring job. At night, soldiers need some ways to relax and relieve stress.
Our army only has one night without sleep, while our enemy has one whole night of trying to sleep but can’t.

[l_simp_chinese.MODULE_SPECIAL_DJ]
DJ台

[l_simp_chinese.MODULE_SPECIAL_DJ_desc]
战争是一件劳累的工作，夜晚的时候，士兵们需要一些放松的方式来减轻压力。
我们的军队只是一晚上没有睡觉而已，而我们的敌军可是一晚上都在尝试睡觉而睡不着。
